    "overview": "The Ant Esports PS330 combines 3 universal three-pin sockets with 3 USB-A ports in a single 2500W power strip, letting you run appliances and charge devices at the same time from one compact unit. Its 3-metre heavy-duty cord stays tangle-free whether coiled in a bag or stretched across a room, and smart charging technology automatically adjusts current output to each connected USB device for faster, safer charging. Built from high-quality fire-resistant PC material rated up to 1382°F, with 1.25mm² pure copper wiring inside, it guards against over-current, over-charge, short circuits and overheating. Safety shutters and grounded sockets add another layer of protection for homes with children, making it a dependable everyday extension cord for home or office appliances.",
